cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FormalSLT in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "FormalSLT: Formal Statistical Learning Theory in Lean 4"
authors:
  - family-names: Sneiderman
    given-names: Robby
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/Robby955/lean-statistical-learning"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Robby955/lean-statistical-learning"
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of finite-sample statistical learning theory bounds,
  including ERM, Rademacher symmetrization, VC-style generalization,
  finite contraction, linear predictors, finite sub-Gaussian chaining,
  algorithmic stability, and finite PAC-Bayes confidence bounds.
